  <p id="c-nanshi-059-wangjian-sengru-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-059-wangjian-sengru-context:p001:m0000" ref="59d_72d_924_AAA">王僧孺</persName>字僧孺，東海郯人也。魏衛將軍肅八世孫也。曾祖<persName id="c-nanshi-059-wangjian-sengru-context:p001:m0025" ref="59d_72d_924">雅</persName>，晉左光祿大夫、儀同三司。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-059-wangjian-sengru-context:p001:m0040" ref="59d_72d_924_A">准之</persName>，宋司徒左長史。父<persName id="c-nanshi-059-wangjian-sengru-context:p001:m0051" ref="59d_72d_924_AA">延年</persName>，員外常侍，未拜卒。</p>
</text>
